title: "MESIN INTI — Market Data Engine with Gates That Can Say No"
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yasin
    given-names: Iqbal Muhammad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-2277-6917"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
    city: Jakarta
    country: ID
abstract: >-
  A market-data pipeline built so that every stage carries a guard and every
  guard can refuse. Publishes gate definitions, an exit-code contract that
  distinguishes "cannot check" from "passed", and a dated sabotage campaign
  in which the author's own guards were deliberately broken to prove they can
  fail. Core tuned values are private by design; the surrounding discipline
  is published.
keywords:
